<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Transparansi Keuangan — <%= APP_NAME %></title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Outfit:wght@300;400;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    body {
      font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f172a 0%, #1e3a5f 50%, #0f172a 100%);
      padding: 24px;
    }
    .card {
      background: rgba(255,255,255,.06);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12);
      border-radius: 20px;
      padding: 48px 40px;
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 420px;
      text-align: center;
      backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
      box-shadow: 0 24px 64px rgba(0,0,0,.4);
    }
    .icon {
      width: 72px; height: 72px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0ea5e9, #38bdf8);
      border-radius: 20px;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      font-size: 32px;
      margin: 0 auto 20px;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(14,165,233,.4);
    }
    h1 { font-size: 22px; font-weight: 800; color: #f1f5f9; margin-bottom: 6px; }
    .sub { font-size: 13px; color: #94a3b8; margin-bottom: 32px; line-height: 1.5; }
    .info {
      background: rgba(14,165,233,.1);
      border: 1px solid rgba(14,165,233,.25);
      border-radius: 10px;
      padding: 12px 16px;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #7dd3fc;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
      text-align: left;
    }
    label { display: block; text-align: left; font-size: 13px; color: #94a3b8; margin-bottom: 6px; font-weight: 600; }
    input[type="text"], input[type="password"] {
      width: 100%;
      padding: 12px 16px;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,.08);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.15);
      border-radius: 10px;
      color: #f1f5f9;
      font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;
      font-size: 15px;
      letter-spacing: 4px;
      text-align: center;
      outline: none;
      transition: border-color .2s;
    }
    input:focus { border-color: #0ea5e9; background: rgba(14,165,233,.08); }
    .error-box {
      background: rgba(239,68,68,.1);
      border: 1px solid rgba(239,68,68,.3);
      border-radius: 10px;
      padding: 10px 14px;
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #fca5a5;
      margin: 12px 0;
    }
    button {
      width: 100%;
      margin-top: 16px;
      padding: 13px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0ea5e9, #0284c7);
      border: none;
      border-radius: 10px;
      color: #fff;
      font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;
      font-size: 15px;
      font-weight: 700;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: opacity .2s, transform .1s;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(14,165,233,.35);
    }
    button:hover { opacity: .9; }
    button:active { transform: scale(.98); }
    .footer { margin-top: 28px; font-size: 11px; color: #475569; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="card">
    <div class="icon">💧</div>
    <h1><%= APP_NAME %></h1>
    <p class="sub">Transparansi Keuangan<br>untuk Masyarakat</p>

    <div class="info">
      Halaman ini menampilkan laporan keuangan organisasi secara terbuka. Masukkan kode akses yang diberikan oleh pengurus PAM.
    </div>

    <form method="POST" action="/publik">
      <label for="kode">Kode Akses</label>
      <input type="password" name="kode" id="kode" placeholder="••••••••" autofocus autocomplete="off" maxlength="20">
      <% if (error) { %>
      <div class="error-box"><%= error %></div>
      <% } %>
      <button type="submit">Lihat Laporan Keuangan</button>
    </form>

    <p class="footer">Informasi: hubungi pengurus PAM untuk mendapatkan kode akses</p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
